{"publicId":"e85c1591-678a-445e-b8e5-a15c3c5fdb20","title":"Ledger迪拜用户遭硬件植入盗币事件确认损失超60万美元，暂停销售并启动赔偿调查","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T21:29:11.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-18T21:29:11.000Z","digest":"Ledger确认迪拜两家Virgin Megastore销售的两台设备被植入硬件篡改程序，导致至少两名用户损失约1300枚SOL和50.7万枚USDT（按当前汇率约合60万美元）。此前的亚洲和欧洲案例均被证实为软件漏洞，现迪拜案例首次揭露物理入侵手法。研究登记项目显示其中一台设备已通过照片确认存在植入物，另一台仍在核查（PANews 2026-11-18 10:44）。后续报道显示Ledger已暂停迪拜Virgin Megastore的销售，并确认柏林地区存在同类硬件篡改事件，目前正调查迪拜用户的赔偿事宜（The Defiant 2026-11-19 05:29）。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-18T22:17:44.082Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Ledger 确认柏林钱包被篡改，调查迪拜赔偿事宜","latestReport":{"id":"on9ads79uk086gwgoe4qv1hgl"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":3,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":4,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fwypTJq8K4Pg","title":"Ledger确认柏林钱包篡改并调查迪拜","firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T21:29:11.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"on9ads79uk086gwgoe4qv1hgl","title":"Ledger 确认柏林钱包被篡改，调查迪拜赔偿事宜","summary":"Ledger 的阿联酋经销商目录显示 Virgin Megastores 的 Ledger 销售暂时暂停，调查者 ZachXBT 正督促公司处理赔偿事宜。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T21:29:11.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"on9ads79uk086gwgoe4qv1hgl","title":"Ledger 确认柏林钱包被篡改，调查迪拜赔偿事宜","summary":"Ledger 的阿联酋经销商目录显示 Virgin Megastores 的 Ledger 销售暂时暂停，调查者 ZachXBT 正督促公司处理赔偿事宜。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T21:29:11.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-18T07:00:00.000Z","heat":26.7,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-18T10:00:00.000Z","heat":24.5,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-18T11:00:00.000Z","heat":23.8,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-18T12:00:00.000Z","heat":23.1,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-18T13:00:00.000Z","heat":22.4,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-18T14:00:00.000Z","heat":21.8,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-18T15:00:00.000Z","heat":21.2,"participants":3},{"hour"